5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to understand why we feel crowded or alone. Let's look at the shared house time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who pays for what. I will check the separately booked room costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I sleep badly away from home. I need to know about bathing hours and bathrooms.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Travel eats my days. I will check the ferry and train times.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I hate surprise bills. I will look at the all-in rates versus separate meals.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, do you think the bathroom situation affects your sleep?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, knowing the total cost upfront would help me plan too.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, the water temperature and timing matter a lot to me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"The train time is short, but the ferry takes two days. That is a problem.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will also check the valley inn rates to compare the total cost.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also look at how last year's days ran to see the pattern.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will check the pricing of offshore houses to see if it is fair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the inn mealtimes to see if I can eat when I am hungry.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check getting around by train and bus to see if I can rest.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check the valley inn rates versus urban beds to see the difference.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
