35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Last year we barely met. The shared house year had no space for alone time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more for some. The island house is 5,400 yen a head.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The island house has one bathroom and cold water. The inn has baths until midnight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two days. The train is ninety minutes. The city bus is frequent.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The all-in rate charges the same for everyone. The valley inn is 17,000 yen with meals.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if the ferry takes two days, we lose half the trip.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the valley inn includes meals, which simplifies the bill.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I cannot sleep if the water is cold. The inn seems better for me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The train is much better for my energy.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"The city bed is 12,000 to 20,000 yen, plus meals. The valley is fixed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The city allows alone time, but we might not see each other.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The island house is one bill, but the bathroom is a risk for Minato.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I am worried about the island bathroom. The inn has a schedule, but it is safe.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The city bus stops before seven. The train is reliable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The valley inn is 17,000 yen. The city is variable. I prefer the fixed cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
